# Findings the weekly image scan (.github/workflows/security-scan.yml) may skip.
# Each entry says why, and each reason is one that a pin cannot change. Remove
# an entry the day it stops being true.
#
# pip's vendored copies. Trivy reads src/pip/_vendor/vendor.txt and reports
# the packages pip bundles for its own use as if they were installed. pip
# 26.2.1 — the newest release, and the one the base image ships — still
# vendors msgpack 1.1.2 and setuptools 70.3.0 (pkg_resources). Nothing in this
# application imports either: pip uses msgpack for its own HTTP cache and
# pkg_resources for its own metadata handling, at build time, on input pip
# itself fetched over TLS. Upgrading pip changes nothing until pypa re-vendors.
